  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FSDMOc SME survey Study - Analysis, Reporting and Dissemination</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;EU financial contribution to conduct the second edition of FinScope MSME Survey in Mozambique. The survey is designed to support the understanding of the state of MSME level of financial inclusion in Mozambique, and the designing and shaping of policies, regulations and interventions for extending the reach of financial services to MSMEs, grow their business and contribute to economic development.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
